{"src":"es","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":187000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"es","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9286.111746,"text":"Los leones son los felinos que más socializan y su vida transcurre dentro de grupos de gran tamaño denominados manadas."},{"kind":"text","t":9627.517662,"text":"Lions are the most social felines, and their lives take place within large groups called prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":9672.88367,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9674.509654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":9676.2099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9677.990817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9679.512184,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":14733.590697,"text":"En medio del cálido clima del Oriente Medio, la casa no era de mayor importancia."},{"kind":"text","t":15052.474886999998,"text":"Amidst the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was of little importance."},{"kind":"audio","t":15107.891924000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15109.373591000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":15111.006405999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15112.658399000002,"samples":32496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":21763.356408,"text":"Las playas son casi todas de arena con lugares seguros para nadar y en su mayoría tienen árboles."},{"kind":"text","t":22062.734204999997,"text":"Almost all the beaches are sandy with safe places to swim and mostly have trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":22117.382375999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22118.939186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22120.551119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22122.423904,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":22122.582583,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":25901.99905,"text":"Poutukawa, que ofrecen lugares de sombra."},{"kind":"text","t":26093.310352999997,"text":"Poutukawa, which provide shaded areas."},{"kind":"audio","t":26145.811206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26147.254335999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":26147.865243999997,"samples":16064,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":33893.389234999995,"text":"Las manadas están formadas por uno a tres machos adultos del mismo grupo familiar, unidos con hasta 30 hembras y sus crías."},{"kind":"text","t":34370.652292,"text":"The pods consist of one to three adult males from the same family group, joined by up to 30 females and their calves."},{"kind":"audio","t":34430.439048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34432.180876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34433.949295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34435.689601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34437.581013999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34439.464766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":34439.625547999996,"samples":7992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42810.135985,"text":"Es posible que los niños salvajes hayan sufrido situaciones traumáticas o abuso infantil grave antes de ser abandonados o de que huyeran."},{"kind":"text","t":43162.207414,"text":"It is possible that feral children suffered traumatic situations or severe child abuse before being abandoned or fleeing."},{"kind":"audio","t":43224.462271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43225.850998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43227.491624999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":43229.19846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43230.993128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43232.842147999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43233.799287,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":49888.130377,"text":"En Skoturb, el autobús 403 se dirige con regularidad a Sintra y para en Cabo da Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":50290.789623,"text":"In Skoturb, bus 403 regularly goes to Sintra and stops at Cabo da Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":50347.661116999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":50349.413161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50351.142139999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50352.959121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":50354.885377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":50355.010655,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":56687.831567,"text":"La forma de disfrutar las mejores vistas de Hong Kong es salir de la isla y dirigirse a la ribera de Kowloon."},{"kind":"text","t":57105.606977999996,"text":"The best way to enjoy the best views of Hong Kong is to leave the island and head to the Kowloon waterfront."},{"kind":"audio","t":57165.536208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":57166.982412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":57168.603099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":57170.409614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":57172.225063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":57173.401943,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":65814.401569,"text":"ubicada enfrente. Los pensamientos de Aristóteles, en especial las cuestiones de la ciencia, incluso la psicología, fueron aceptadas."},{"kind":"text","t":66202.131693,"text":"located opposite. Aristotle's thoughts, especially the questions of science, and even psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":66251.981872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66252.409545,"samples":18232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"audio","t":66297.147428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66298.543276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66300.320087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66302.094144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66303.319506,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":73772.659938,"text":"Mitchell Gurley de Australia obtuvo el undécimo puesto en la categoría masculina de pie del slalom supergigante."},{"kind":"text","t":74129.91241599999,"text":"Mitchell Gurley from Australia finished eleventh in the men's standing super-G slalom category."},{"kind":"audio","t":74188.722083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74190.13097099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74191.887392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74193.681308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74195.63118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":74195.778641,"samples":5960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":80682.10909,"text":"El competidor checo, Oldrik Jelinek, terminó decimosexto en el grupo masculino de sentados."},{"kind":"text","t":81051.842411,"text":"The Czech competitor, Oldrik Jelinek, finished sixteenth in the men's sitting group."},{"kind":"audio","t":81108.381835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81109.97100399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":81111.730639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81113.641221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":81113.794872,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":87071.389437,"text":"La ciudad contrasta mucho con los restantes del país, ya que posee un estilo más árabe que africano."},{"kind":"text","t":87454.723673,"text":"The city contrasts sharply with the rest of the country, as it has a more Arabic than African style."},{"kind":"audio","t":87512.698254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87514.445711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87516.183323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87518.049549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87519.870967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":87520.049866,"samples":1760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":93369.020729,"text":"Asimismo, luego de la revolución, los puestos estuvieron abiertos a todos los candidatos masculinos."},{"kind":"text","t":93658.80217,"text":"Likewise, after the revolution, the positions were open to all male candidates."},{"kind":"audio","t":93715.67335299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":93717.178565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":93718.976749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93720.765758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93721.171278,"samples":13528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":98733.744016,"text":"lo que permitió el éxito de los más ambiciosos y prestigiosos."},{"kind":"text","t":98942.315976,"text":"which allowed the most ambitious and prestigious to succeed."},{"kind":"audio","t":98995.63553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":98997.084448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98998.939888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":98999.05918699999,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107499.83452799999,"text":"La bomba atómica opera en base al principio de que se requiere energía para conformar un núcleo con gran cantidad de protones y neutrones."},{"kind":"text","t":107928.69699499999,"text":"The atomic bomb operates on the principle that energy is required to form a nucleus with a large number of protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":107990.19108799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107991.771183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107993.491088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107995.27877599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107997.016228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107998.944997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108000.243349,"samples":27192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":114666.059234,"text":"No mencionó una cifra para los recortes y manifestó que se harán en base a la producción económica de China."},{"kind":"text","t":115096.386453,"text":"He did not mention a figure for the cuts and stated that they will be made based on China's economic production."},{"kind":"audio","t":115155.71139499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115157.278571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":115159.037555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115160.854817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115162.64532899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":115163.260453,"samples":15560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121248.301144,"text":"No hay un criterio universal que determine cuándo un bien manufacturado puede ser considerado una antigüedad."},{"kind":"text","t":121570.034207,"text":"There is no universal criterion to determine when a manufactured good can be considered an antique."},{"kind":"audio","t":121629.28099099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121630.913866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121632.547842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121634.305634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121636.077698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121636.731121,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":128057.714245,"text":"Algunas agencias impositivas tienen establecido que los objetos de más de 100 años son antigüedades."},{"kind":"text","t":128379.266576,"text":"Some tax agencies have established that objects over 100 years old are antiques."},{"kind":"audio","t":128435.625338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128437.191863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":128439.000272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128440.809492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128442.947475,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":140347.386915,"text":"No siempre se precisa un yate en los archipiélagos y lagos."},{"kind":"text","t":140619.47180200001,"text":"A yacht is not always necessary in the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":140673.806432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140675.157123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":140676.923688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140677.812374,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":143174.396443,"text":"Por ello se dice que la relación dimensional de este formato, dividir por 12 a fin de calcular la razón de números enteros más sencilla, equivale a 3.2."},{"kind":"text","t":143812.34050800002,"text":"That is why it is said that the dimensional relationship of this format—dividing by 12 in order to calculate the simplest integer ratio—is equivalent to 3.2."},{"kind":"audio","t":143878.649057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143880.20504700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143881.95033000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143883.70579900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143885.53305600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143887.40538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143889.256503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":143891.19874300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":480,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143893.193021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":143893.31254100002,"samples":5688,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":153334.351345,"text":"Su fama de ser epicentro del lujo comenzó aproximadamente en el 400 a.C. y se extendió hasta aproximadamente 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":153821.16554000002,"text":"Its reputation for being an epicenter of luxury began approximately in 400 BC and extended until approximately 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":153886.426776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153888.02723200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153889.66349200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153891.44728300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153893.19571200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":153894.993224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":153896.926199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153898.816381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153899.51444,"samples":18656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":165736.046405,"text":"Existen diferentes tipos de pólizas de cancelación de viajes, pero desde finales del marzo, la cobertura de gran parte de estas pólizas basadas en el coronavirus no se extiende hasta julio de 2020."},{"kind":"text","t":166382.755536,"text":"There are different types of travel cancellation policies, but since the end of March, the coverage of many of these coronavirus-based policies does not extend until July 2020."},{"kind":"audio","t":166470.16713000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166471.71387500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166473.38085100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166475.241768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":166477.22316700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166479.11457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166480.963009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166482.78454700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166484.624443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":166485.017965,"samples":13488,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":168609.21261000002,"text":"que es para cuando están programados los Juegos Olímpicos."},{"kind":"text","t":168810.81917,"text":"which is when the Olympic Games are scheduled."},{"kind":"audio","t":168862.91872000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":168864.416682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":168864.78510600002,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":177240.177842,"text":"Agite ambos polvos secos juntos y después de hacerlo con las manos higienizadas y húmedas, exprímalos para formar una bola."},{"kind":"text","t":177624.50348900002,"text":"Shake both dry powders together and then, using sanitized and damp hands, squeeze them to form a ball."},{"kind":"audio","t":177682.98197800003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177684.57357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":177686.333155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177688.144769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":177689.978065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177691.05922000002,"samples":22760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":186672.20896500003,"text":"Durante los cruceros por San Petersburgo también se pasa tiempo en la ciudad. Se exime a quienes desembarcan de los requerimientos de visado. Consulte términos."},{"kind":"text","t":186939.300507,"text":"Time is also spent in the city during cruises to Saint Petersburg. Those disembarking are exempt from visa requirements. See terms."},{"kind":"audio","t":186995.20454600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":186996.691992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186998.51920900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186999.688326,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"audio","t":187051.456057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187052.956803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187054.971522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":187055.08810700002,"samples":5496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":187083.59478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":187083.760459,"samples":6232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":197102.51091200003,"code":1005}]}